<section class="panel cp-span-full" id="dates">
    <h2>Release Date, Beta and Editions</h2>
    <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Public beta: <strong>September 17, 2026</strong>, through <strong>October 21, 2026</strong> PST — beta access included with the Skyborne Epic Pack and Warcraft Forever Collection</li>
        <li>Live Q&A: Thursday, September 17, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. PT (5:00 p.m. UTC) on the official Warcraft Twitch and YouTube channels, per Blizzard's Q&A announcement</li>
        <li>Early Name Reservation: <strong>October 27 through November 3, 2026</strong>, included with any upgrade purchase — up to three characters, first-come first-served</li>
        <li>Global launch: <strong>November 4, 2026 at 3:00 p.m. PST</strong></li>
        <li>First new raids: <strong>December 9, 2026</strong></li>
        <li>Access: included with a WoW subscription or game time; optional Skyborne upgrade packs are the paid editions</li>
        <li>Level cap: 60, permanently — Blizzard confirmed the cap "will always be" 60</li>
    </ul>
</section>

