            The elemental skybound starting experience for Skyborne characters, covering <strong>levels 1 through 12</strong>. A floating island described in coverage as wooden docks in the clouds with ships anchored by chains to stone spires, blending Classic Warcraft aesthetics with architecture inspired by Skywall, domain of Al'Akir the Windlord (per panel recap, NoobToBoss and Inven Global).
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

